{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the enchanting world of &quot;Catch Up&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get ready to embark on an exciting precision platforming adventure like you've never seen before! Join an epic journey with a brave cat where skill and precision will be your best allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/163262f611f0ac7c42736bfcf0bdc439.webp?t=1726776664\" width=640 height=48 /></span>&quot;Catch Up&quot; is a challenging 2D game with high-quality pixelated graphics that will transport you to three unique and stunning biomes. Explore vibrant and detailed landscapes, from lush forests to Dark Places and Ancient Ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your mission is to help our courageous feline find the way back home. However, it won't be an easy task! Face cleverly designed obstacles in every corner of the biomes. Enjoy the evolution of your movements and jumps, improving your skills throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original soundtrack will immerse you even further into this captivating world. Each melody has been carefully composed to accompany your journey, creating an engaging and thrilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to push the platforming boundaries in &quot;Catch Up&quot;! Prepare for a unique gaming experience where precision and dexterity are essential for success. Master the control of our adorable feline protagonist and pave the way back home in this immersive and addictive game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept the challenge and prove your skills in &quot;Catch Up&quot; - a game that will test your reflexes, patience, and determination, all within a charming pixelated universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help this little kitten get back home? The fate of our cat is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Get ready for the perils of platforms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way is up, and your only enemy is yourself! Tension builds with every jump, as a simple mistake results in a long fall - and you have to climb it all again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hold to charge, release to jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly simple act of jumping will take a long time to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use your mind before jumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The obvious path is not always the best, and once you're in the air, there's no turning back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The higher you jump, the harder the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress and each fall are automatically saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends to master this test of determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of frustration await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/a69ccf9c542c0e2f7129fbf37913dcac.avif?t=1726776664\" width=640 height=224 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 Jumps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547030/0dd76e47e490b5777a051becff5820541ad6577e.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Jumps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547030/8023b0d57052df42e2f0ad5454992896536d0c05.jpg"},{"name":"End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547030/175cd63cf041caff5a1671a9d7d921cf820e5409.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547030/a58c13247b81cade1d192be2e86e75afbb34a476.jpg"},{"name":"Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547030/67b2605ea45abe669f75e9b688cbf4488f1463a2.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2547030?t=1726776664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1726776664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726776664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726776664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the enchanting world of &quot;Catch Up&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/fcd2a13ce7ddff8fb071cfab8ba4b5ab.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get ready to embark on an exciting precision platforming adventure like you've never seen before! Join an epic journey with a brave cat where skill and precision will be your best allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/163262f611f0ac7c42736bfcf0bdc439.webp?t=1726776664\" width=640 height=48 /></span>&quot;Catch Up&quot; is a challenging 2D game with high-quality pixelated graphics that will transport you to three unique and stunning biomes. Explore vibrant and detailed landscapes, from lush forests to Dark Places and Ancient Ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/d1f2330082a28981506ffe0772f00e26.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your mission is to help our courageous feline find the way back home. However, it won't be an easy task! Face cleverly designed obstacles in every corner of the biomes. Enjoy the evolution of your movements and jumps, improving your skills throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original soundtrack will immerse you even further into this captivating world. Each melody has been carefully composed to accompany your journey, creating an engaging and thrilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to push the platforming boundaries in &quot;Catch Up&quot;! Prepare for a unique gaming experience where precision and dexterity are essential for success. Master the control of our adorable feline protagonist and pave the way back home in this immersive and addictive game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept the challenge and prove your skills in &quot;Catch Up&quot; - a game that will test your reflexes, patience, and determination, all within a charming pixelated universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help this little kitten get back home? The fate of our cat is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Get ready for the perils of platforms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way is up, and your only enemy is yourself! Tension builds with every jump, as a simple mistake results in a long fall - and you have to climb it all again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hold to charge, release to jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly simple act of jumping will take a long time to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use your mind before jumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The obvious path is not always the best, and once you're in the air, there's no turning back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.poster.avif?t=1726776664\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.webm?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/64a5d998fd7a856e1d8ef677acc6e88a.mp4?t=1726776664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The higher you jump, the harder the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress and each fall are automatically saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends to master this test of determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of frustration await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/extras/a69ccf9c542c0e2f7129fbf37913dcac.avif?t=1726776664\" width=640 height=224 /></span></p>","developers":["Rebeli\u00e3o Studio"],"dlc":[2586480],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547030/header.jpg?t=1726776664","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X version 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Mac<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2547030/594156/a464d635dbf03da84ddbd096fa5df29c431c3c2c/1750930168/dash_av1.mpd?t=1691591229","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2547030/594156/a464d635dbf03da84ddbd096fa5df29c431c3c2c/1750930168/dash_h264.mpd?t=1691591229","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2547030/594156/a464d635dbf03da84ddbd096fa5df29c431c3c2c/1750930168/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1691591229","id":256961963,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256961963/movie480.mp4?t=1691591229","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256961963/movie_max.mp4?t=1691591229"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256961963/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1691591229","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steam