e! Join an epic journey with a brave cat where skill and precision will be your best allies.","steam_appid":2547030,"support_info":{"email":"contato@rebeliaostudio.com","url":"https://rebeliaostudio.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://rebeliaostudio.com"}